{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2022-04-07 02:15:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. ANNOUNCES REVISED AGREEMENT TO SELL WILLIAM HILL NON-US ASSETS TO 888 HOLDINGS PLC', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS AND RENO, NEV. , APRIL 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS") TODAY ANNOUNCED A REVISED AGREEMENT TO SELL THE NON-US ASSETS OF WILLIAM HILL TO 888 HOLDINGS PLC FOR A REVISED ENTERPRISE VALUE OF BETWEEN £1.95 BILLION AND £2.05 BILLION.'}